{"D:\\wt\\ssimple5\\vlog\\ssimple5\\voz\\b000_t5.wav": {"text": "This is my mother's furoshiki, a square of blue cotton cloth she carried for 60 years. With this one cloth, she never needed a shopping bag, a gift box, or a roll of wrapping paper. She lived to 101 in Osaka. After 60, she stopped buying nine things, one by one, and she never missed any of them. Today, I will tell you all nine. And number nine is the one that kept her comfortable for 40 years on a very small pension when many of her friends were worried every month. One of them she replaced with a big kettle and a handful of roasted barley. Another one she replaced with a square of old cotton cut from my father's shirts. But first, one honest thing. This is not advice from a bank, and I am not telling you how to spend your money. This is just how one old woman in Osaka lived, simple and happy, and I am 79 now, and I do every one of these nine things.", "words": [{"w": " This", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.26}, {"w": " is", "s": 0.26, "e": 0.46}, {"w": " my", "s": 0.46, "e": 0.6}, {"w": " mother's", "s": 0.6, "e": 1.16}, {"w": " furoshiki,", "s": 1.16, "e": 1.8}, {"w": " a", "s": 1.8, "e": 2.4}, {"w": " square", "s": 2.4, "e": 2.76}, {"w": " of", "s": 2.76, "e": 3.0}, {"w": " blue", "s": 3.0, "e": 3.3}, {"w": " cotton", "s": 3.3, "e": 3.7}, {"w": " cloth", "s": 3.7, "e": 4.12}, {"w": " she", "s": 4.12, "e": 4.36}, {"w": " carried", "s": 4.36, "e": 4.72}, {"w": " for", "s": 4.72, "e": 4.96}, {"w": " 60", "s": 4.96, "e": 5.36}, {"w": " years.", "s": 5.36, "e": 6.3}, {"w": " With", "s": 6.42, "e": 6.56}, {"w": " this", "s": 6.56, "e": 6.82}, {"w": " one", "s": 6.82, "e": 7.1}, {"w": " cloth,", "s": 7.1, "e": 7.74}, {"w": " she", "s": 7.74, "e": 7.84}, {"w": " never", "s": 7.84, "e": 8.2}, {"w": " needed", "s": 8.2, "e": 8.54}, {"w": " a", "s": 8.54, "e": 8.7}, {"w": " shopping", "s": 8.7, "e": 9.06}, {"w": " bag,", "s": 9.06, "e": 9.84}, {"w": " a", "s": 9.84, "e": 9.94}, {"w": " gift", "s": 9.94, "e": 10.3}, {"w": " 